export const draftChannels=[['email','Email'],['personal','LinkedIn · manual handoff'],['company','LinkedIn company · inbound reply only'],['x','X · manual handoff'],['instagram','Instagram · manual handoff'],['facebook','Facebook · manual handoff']];
export function renderDraftWorkspace(p,d,{rows,name,reviewed,handoff,storage,escape:e}={}){
  return `<div class="draft-workspace"><header class="dialog-header"><div><span class="opportunity-caption">Engage / Message preparation</span><h2 id="dialog-title">A thoughtful next step.</h2><p>Your words, with the right context beside them.</p></div><button class="close-button" data-action="close" aria-label="Close message workspace">×</button></header><div class="draft-workspace-grid"><article class="draft-card draft-editor"><div class="field"><label for="draft-recipient">Working on</label><select id="draft-recipient">${rows.map(row=>`<option value="${e(row.id)}" ${row.id===p.id?'selected':''}>${e(row.name||row.company||row.email||'Prospect')}</option>`).join('')}</select></div><div class="draft-meta"><div><h3>${e(name)}</h3><small>${e(p.company||'Company not provided')} · ${p.origin==='example'?'Fictional example':'Source review required'}</small></div><span class="badge ${d.ready&&reviewed?'fit':'review'}">${!reviewed?'Review again':d.ready?'Prepared by you':'Draft'}</span></div><div class="draft-controls"><div class="field"><label for="channel-${e(p.id)}">Channel</label><select id="channel-${e(p.id)}" data-draft-id="${e(p.id)}" data-draft-field="channel">${draftChannels.map(([value,label])=>`<option value="${value}" ${d.channel===value?'selected':''}>${label}</option>`).join('')}</select></div><div class="field"><label for="subject-${e(p.id)}">Subject</label><input id="subject-${e(p.id)}" data-draft-id="${e(p.id)}" data-draft-field="subject" value="${e(d.subject)}"></div></div><label class="draft-body-label" for="body-${e(p.id)}">Your message</label><textarea id="body-${e(p.id)}" data-draft-id="${e(p.id)}" data-draft-field="body">${e(d.body)}</textarea><p id="draft-save-state" class="small-print" role="status">${e(storage)}</p><div class="draft-actions"><button class="button primary small" data-prepare="${e(p.id)}" ${reviewed?'':'disabled'}>Mark as prepared</button><button class="button secondary small" data-copy="${e(p.id)}" ${reviewed?'':'disabled'}>Copy message</button>${p.origin!=='example'&&d.ready&&reviewed&&['email','x'].includes(d.channel)?`<button class="button secondary small" data-action="native-send" data-id="${e(p.id)}">Review & send</button>`:''}<button class="link-button" data-prospect="${e(p.id)}">Review evidence</button></div><div id="draft-handoff">${handoff||''}</div><p class="small-print">${d.channel==='company'?'Use only to reply to an existing inbound page conversation.':'Pull does not send automated social messages. A prepared draft has not been sent.'}</p></article><aside class="draft-preview" aria-label="Message preview and recipient context"><span class="opportunity-caption">Message preview</span><div class="draft-preview-context"><strong>${e(name)}</strong><span>${e([p.title,p.company].filter(Boolean).join(' · '))}</span><span>${e(p.location||p.country||'Location not provided')}</span></div><section class="draft-preview-paper"><span class="opportunity-caption" id="draft-preview-channel">${e(draftChannels.find(([v])=>v===d.channel)?.[1]||d.channel)}</span><h3 id="draft-preview-subject">${e(d.subject||'No subject')}</h3><p id="draft-preview-body">${e(d.body)}</p></section><div class="draft-preview-note"><strong>Context to keep in mind</strong><p>${e(p.search_match||p.signal||'Use only details you have checked. Do not infer buying intent from a job title.')}</p><span class="badge ${reviewed?'fit':'review'}">${reviewed?'Shortlisted by you':'Evidence review required'}</span></div></aside></div></div>`;
}
